WEBVTT

00:02:27.519 --> 00:02:30.014
to increase overseas aid payments

00:02:30.014 --> 00:02:32.283
to 0.7 percent

00:02:32.283 --> 00:02:33.922
of their national income.

00:02:33.922 --> 00:02:38.199
As you can see, a big gap opens up

00:02:38.199 --> 00:02:42.793
between actual aid and that target.

00:02:42.793 --> 00:02:47.056
But then come the Millennium Development Goals,

00:02:47.056 --> 00:02:49.465
eight ambitious targets

00:02:49.465 --> 00:02:53.373
to be met by 2015.

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:56.368
If I tell you that just one of those targets

00:02:56.368 --> 00:03:00.551
is to eradicate extreme hunger and poverty,